      "text": "Went back to eat with more Espressif people lol\nThe food actually good lmao\n\nTldr like\nShould play more before working money can earn back once you start working\n\nAlso when even espressif ceo say that AI creates braindead employees you know that maybe AI has gone too far lol\n\nOK lah hearing that it's good that I've decided to play more\n",
