      "text": "There was some poster about some anime event at the metro so I just went\nIt's bout what I expected, pop up shops\n\nI've actually not been in this anime mall (it's more like a mix of fashion and normal shops and a whole bunch of anime goods) before, got a lot of things going on like an animatecafe, woodworking workshops for anime goods wtf\n",
