      "telegram_timestamp": "2026-07-24T18:57:01.000Z",
      "markdown_sha256": "903cde0175fd5ded2a46bb0af623c83a85640fd50c53b62a3d1450412c42cd8a",
      "body_sha256": "6a2a3b992f19d726db138c1307435fa40bb5fabd90dd567aab57e3e9d1b3360c",
      "text": "And then now I'm having an internal crisis about not spending more days in Shanghai man...\n\nI extended 1 day because I wanted to meet espressif people which I did, twice, was freaking fun ngl\n\nI was thinking about going up the pearl tower but eh I saw the images and it's fine \n\nTrip to ancient town but no time because the Espressif thing + acting as a tour guide wah\n\nI was really reminiscing about the days in Shanghai and it really does feel like there are other museums and other things to see\nBut then again the reason I enjoyed my time last time was really... Not because of all that but actually because of the memories and the fun times at work, out of work with other Singaporeans, trolling CG3207. The sights and all that were a nice addition, very nice\n",
